Notebook[{
Cell["\<\
Graviton Basis Toolkit: Mathematical Background, User Guide, Validation, and \
Worked Reduction Example\
\>", "Title",ExpressionUUID->"d3f22753-a74a-1d46-86a2-51bb55bcc05e"],

Cell["\<\
This report consolidates the mathematical setup, the software interface, the \
validation logic, and a nontrivial worked reduction example for \
graviton_basis_toolkit.wl. The emphasis is on connecting the abstract \
quotient constructions to the actual Mathematica computation.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"52acda79-14d0-3b44-a6f0-1d1dded09f0f"],

